!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: BI2536 4.2nM
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = time: 8 days
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = A Nalm-6 clone with inducible expression of Cas9 was thawed, and Cas9 expression induced with doxycycline at 2 µg/mL for 7 days (see Bertomeu et al., 2017 for details). The pooled EKO library was split in different T-75 flasks, compounds added, and propagated for 8 days. Fresh media and compound was added at each cell passage.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Nalm-6 cells were grown in 10% FBS (v/v) (Wisent) RPMI 1640 medium (Wisent) at 5% (v/v) CO2 and 37°C.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Samples were PBS-washed and cell pellets frozen. Genomic DNA was extracted using the QIAamp DNA blood maxi kit (Qiagen).
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = sgRNA libraries were prepared by PCR amplification to add sequencing adapters and indices.
!Sample_description = Illumina HiSeq 2000 and Illumina NextSeq 500
!Sample_description = sgRNAs PCR-amplified from genomic DNA
!Sample_description = BI2536_4.2nM
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were aligned using Bowtie2.2.5 in the forward direction only (--norc option) with otherwise default parameters and total read counts per sgRNA were tabulated.
!Sample_data_processing = Read counts from different sequencing lanes for the same sample were summed and counts for all control samples were summed.
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: For Nalm-6 screens: EKO sgRNA library (Bertomeu et al. 2017, PMID:29038160), using only the core RefSeq gene-targeting sgRNA set of of the library.
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: Tab-separated sgRNA read counts per sample
